# Optional override for a custom relay. The desktop defaults to the deployed MadokaChanger relay.
# For local development only, use: http://127.0.0.1:8787
# Set in the desktop process environment on both PCs and restart after changing it.
# The desktop does not load .env automatically. No member tokens or LCU credentials here.
# MADOKACHANGER_DUO_URL=https://your-worker.your-subdomain.workers.dev
